### Logout (invalidates this JWT until expiry)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get account by id (self or ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/auth/accounts/a1b0b56d-7693-4f75-b42d-1138cfa5f824
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update account status — ADMIN only
### Blank line below headers is required — otherwise `{` is parsed as a header name.
PATCH {{host}}/auth/accounts/48c10410-8193-49c7-92b8-33ac1c405d11/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "SUSPENDED"
}
